 *  setReadTraceTarget(idx) starts counting getReg reads of that int phys
 *  slot; clearReadTraceTarget() stops. getReg increments read_count if a
 *  target is set and matches. This directly measures whether the injected
 *  phys reg was actually read after injection — the clean closure check
 *  for SDC(active) vs SDC(superseded-with-readers) vs SDC(dead).
 *  Hot-path cost: one int compare + a branch only when a target is active
 *  (almost always -1, i.e. no injection in flight). */
